{{also|Tausend}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|tūsunt}}, from {{inh|de|goh|dūsunt}}, akin to Old Saxon {{m|osx|thūsund}}. Ultimately from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*þūsundī}}. Compare Dutch {{m|de|duizend}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|tûzen}}, English ''[[thousand]]'', Danish {{m|da|tusind}}.

